{"ref":"BDB, עֵירֹם","hw":"עֵירֹם","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">עֵירֹם</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">עֵרֹם</span></big>  <strong>adj.</strong> and <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>1. naked</strong>; <strong>2. nakedness (</strong> √ <span dir=\"rtl\">עור</span> Ew <sup>423, 426</sup> Ges<sup>§ 85 t</sup> Sta<sup>§§ 295, 327 a</sup>; > √ <span dir=\"rtl\">ערם</span> (not Heb. in this sense) Ba<sup>NB § 27 g</sup> Kö<sup>ii. 84, 120</sup><strong>)</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">עֵירֹם</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 3:10\" href=\"/Genesis.3.10\">Gn 3:10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 3:11\" href=\"/Genesis.3.11\">11</a> + 4 times, <span dir=\"rtl\">עֵרֹם</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 16:7\" href=\"/Ezekiel.16.7\">Ez 16:7</a> + 2 times Ez; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">עֵירֻמִּים</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 3:7\" href=\"/Genesis.3.7\">Gn 3:7</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <strong>adj.</strong> <em>naked</em> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 3:7\" href=\"/Genesis.3.7\">Gn 3:7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 3:10\" href=\"/Genesis.3.10\">10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 3:11\" href=\"/Genesis.3.11\">11</a> (all pred.); as subst. concr. <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 18:7\" href=\"/Ezekiel.18.7\">Ez 18:7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 18:16\" href=\"/Ezekiel.18.16\">16</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <strong>n.abstr.</strong> <em>nakedness</em> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 28:48\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.28.48\">Dt 28:48</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">ע׳ וְעֶרְיָה</span> <em>nakedness and bareness</em> (= naked and bare, of personified Jerusalem), <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 16:7\" href=\"/Ezekiel.16.7\">Ez 16:7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 16:22\" href=\"/Ezekiel.16.22\">22</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 16:39\" href=\"/Ezekiel.16.39\">39</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 23:29\" href=\"/Ezekiel.23.29\">23:29</a>.","next":"BDB, עָרוֹם","prev":"BDB, מָעוֹר²"}